{"id":"1b06c1162d3facfd","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-heegaard-splitting.md","title":"Heegaard Splitting","display":"df-heegaard-splitting — Heegaard Splitting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-heegaard-splitting","aliases":["58-df-heegaard-splitting"],"display":"df-heegaard-splitting — Heegaard Splitting","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-heegaard-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-heegaard-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-heegaard-splitting — Heegaard Splitting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"157244bd3dfd5b5d\" href=\"?note=157244bd3dfd5b5d\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md\">../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb1491fbbaff37d\" href=\"?note=1cb1491fbbaff37d\" title=\"58-df-diffeomorphism\">58-df-diffeomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)\\)</span>（光滑 3-流形，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H&#39;,3,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H&#39;,3,g)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"157244bd3dfd5b5d\" href=\"?note=157244bd3dfd5b5d\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md\">../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)\">\\(\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是该光滑 1-handlebody 的边界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,3)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,3)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 的平滑边界粘合</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B&#39;,2,2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B&#39;,2,2)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cb1491fbbaff37d\" href=\"?note=1cb1491fbbaff37d\" title=\"58-df-diffeomorphism\">58-df-diffeomorphism</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义，显式记录边界见证与属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}data}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,g)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H&#39;,3,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B&#39;,H&#39;,3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B&#39;,2,2)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,3).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}data}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,g)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H&#39;,3,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B&#39;,H&#39;,3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B&#39;,2,2)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,3).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S(M,H,H&#39;,\\phi,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,B&#39;\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S(M,H,H&#39;,\\phi,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,B&#39;\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H&#39;,B,B&#39;,\\phi,g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every closed 3-manifold admits a Heegaard splitting.</li>\n<li>Heegaard genus bounds complexity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(M) \\geq \\frac{1}{2}b_1(M)\">\\(g(M) \\geq \\frac{1}{2}b_1(M)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Stabilization: adding a trivial handle raises genus by 1.</li>\n<li>Reidemeister–Singer says any two Heegaard splittings admit a common stabilization; unstabilized splittings need not be unique.</li>\n<li>原式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial H\">\\(\\partial H\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\cup_\\phi H&#39;\">\\(H\\cup_\\phi H&#39;\\)</span> 没有由依赖闭包定义。现在边界与平滑粘合被绑定为显式见证，并如实标为当前几何库的元理论边界，而不是未声明的对象语言运算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md","status":"resolved","id":"157244bd3dfd5b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-diffeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-diffeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)$（光滑 3-流形，see [[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md","status":"resolved","id":"157244bd3dfd5b5d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H',3,g)$（see [[../batch15/58-df-handlebody.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-diffeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1cb1491fbbaff37d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B',2,2)$（see [[58-df-diffeomorphism]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H',3,g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H',B,B',\\phi,3)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B',2,2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}data}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}\n&\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H',B,B',\\phi,g)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H,3,g)\\land\\mathrm{Handlebody}_S(H',3,g)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B,H,3)\n\\land\\mathrm{HandlebodyBoundary}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B',H',3)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Diffeomorphism}_S(\\phi,B,B',2,2)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothBoundaryGluing}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(M,H,H',B,B',\\phi,3).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}heegaard\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{HeegaardSplitting}_S(M,H,H',\\phi,g)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,B'\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HeegaardSplittingData}_S(M,H,H',B,B',\\phi,g).","display":true},{"tex":"g(M) \\geq \\frac{1}{2}b_1(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial H","display":false},{"tex":"H\\cup_\\phi H'","display":false}],"bytes":2386,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-612","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-heegaard-splitting.md|58-df-heegaard-splitting]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["157244bd3dfd5b5d","71fe0dc4c8613e69","1cb1491fbbaff37d"]}